@host = http://localhost:5153

### Create order
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "John Doe",
  "product": "Laptop Pro 16",
  "quantity": 1,
  "totalPrice": 2500.00
}

### Get all orders
GET {{host}}/api/orders

### Get order by ID (replace with actual ID)
GET {{host}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}
